<p>When gaining a combo point, you have a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">18%, 29%, 37%, 44%, 50%</acronym> chance to gain an extra combo point.  Additionally, your combo points will last <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> turns longer before expiring.</p><p>The chance of building a second combo point will improve with your Cunning.</p>